<p>Chapter IV runs from printed page 27 through page 33 and holds five stories: a double-jacking mishap underground, a hunting-crew exchange, a drunk driver who pulls himself over, a home-remedy knee treatment that turns into a very different kind of house call, and a mining-camp hermit given to political monologues.</p>

